        "Content": "Front Garden:        \r\n\r\n-\tLow maintenance, paved driveway, off-street parking\r\n\r\n\r\nPorch:                        c.   1.00 x 1.74m\r\n\r\n-\tSliding door, tiled floor\r\n\r\nHall:                          c.    1.73 x 1.71m             \r\n                                                                                             \r\n-\tSquared entrance hall, tiled floor\r\n\r\n\r\nSitting  Room:           c.      6.51 x 4.72m              \r\n                                                                                                                 \r\n-\t‘L’ Shaped sitting room; long open space, gas fire insert, under stairs storage, access to kitchen, wood flooring\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen:                   c.    3.67 x 4.72m\r\n\r\n-\tTo rear, open plan kitchen and dining area, fitted units, built-in electric cooking appliance, access to conservatory, wood flooring\r\n\r\nConservatory:         c.   3.51 x 2.17m\r\n\r\n-\tNatural sun trap, double glazing, double doors to garden\r\n\r\n\r\nLanding:         \t  c.   2.74 x 3.43m\r\n\r\n-\tFirst return with gable wall window, ‘T’ shaped landing, hot press, carpet flooring \r\n\r\nBedroom 1:                   c.   4.24 x 2.71m\t  \t (to front)\r\n\r\n-\tLarge bedroom, built-in sliderobe wardrobes, wood flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:                  c.\t3.61 x 2.36m        (to rear)\r\n\r\n-\tCarpet flooring \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:                 c.   3.73 x 2.23m\t  (to rear)\r\n\r\n-\tCarpet flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom:          \t         c. 2.42 x 1.89m\r\n\r\n-\tFully tiled family bathroom, 2x piece suite, walk-in electric shower.\r\n\r\nBack Garden:        c.   16m in length\r\n\r\n-\tNot overlooked, patio area, in lawn, mature shrubs planted, very private, side entrance from front, ideal space to increase current accommodation (S.S.P.), garden shed, outside water tap"
